OL,3,AGPs, police and pharmacies among UK
OL,4,Aservices affected by Microsoft outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FMajor airports and UK intelligence
OL,7,Fservices have been unaffected by the
OL,8,Foutage, while a minister said officials
OL,9,Fwere assessing the extent of the impact
OL,10,Fon government services.
